{"id": "ar-003", "lang": "ar", "cat": "factual", "answerable": true, "question": "ما هي شروط صحة الزواج في القانون التونسي؟", "answer": "يجب أن يبرم عقد الزواج بالبلاد التونسية أمام عدلين أو ضابط الحالة المدنية بمحضر شاهدين من أهل الثقة، أو يبرم العقد طبق قوانين البلاد التي يتم فيها، وفقًا للفرع 31 من قانون عدد 3 لسنة 1957. [S2]", "status": "answered", "abstain_reason": null, "latency_ms": 49947.848969000006, "timings": {"bm25": 1.097481000215339, "embed": 126.90217399995163, "dense": 12.347405999207695, "rerank": 10865.042145000189, "total": 49947.798487, "llm": 38941.1467230002}, "usage": {"input_tokens": 1658, "output_tokens": 84, "cost_usd": 0.0027748776937222223}, "cited": ["civil_status_1957:art31:1"], "retrieved": ["civil_status_1957:art38:1", "civil_status_1957:art31:1", "civil_status_1957:art36bis:1", "civil_status_1957:art37:1", "premarital_certificate_1964:art7:1"], "verification": {"cited_ids": [2], "invalid_ids": [], "unverified_articles": [], "unsupported_numbers": ["1957"], "sentences": 2}, "citation_precision": 0.0, "gold_cited": false, "support_scores": [0.116695336997509], "faithful_sentences": 0, "cited_sentences": 1, "fact_hits": [true, false], "correct": false, "forbidden_found": []}
{"id": "ar-005", "lang": "ar", "cat": "factual", "answerable": true, "question": "كيف يثبت الزواج في تونس؟", "answer": "يتم ببرم عقد الزواج أمام عدلين أو ضابط الحالة المدنية بمحضر شاهدين من أهل الثقة في البلاد التونسية [S1].而对于在突尼斯证明婚姻，必须在突尼斯境内由两名证人或民政官员见证下签署婚约 [S1]。", "status": "answered", "abstain_reason": null, "latency_ms": 48266.22162300009, "timings": {"bm25": 0.7459900007233955, "embed": 119.69764700006635, "dense": 7.677574999434, "rerank": 10196.327160000692, "total": 48266.128029000356, "llm": 37940.40477800081}, "usage": {"input_tokens": 1655, "output_tokens": 72, "cost_usd": 0.0026814515571666865}, "cited": ["civil_status_1957:art31:1"], "retrieved": ["civil_status_1957:art31:1", "civil_status_1957:art37:1", "civil_status_1957:art38:1", "civil_status_1957:art36bis:1", "premarital_certificate_1964:art7:1"], "verification": {"cited_ids": [1], "invalid_ids": [], "unverified_articles": [], "unsupported_numbers": [], "sentences": 1}, "citation_precision": 0.0, "gold_cited": false, "support_scores": [0.997832715511322], "faithful_sentences": 1, "cited_sentences": 1, "fact_hits": [false], "correct": false, "forbidden_found": []}
