{"id": "ar-007", "lang": "ar", "cat": "factual", "answerable": true, "question": "هل يحق للخطيب استرجاع الهدايا بعد فسخ الخطبة؟", "answer": "خطيب واحد لا يحق له استرجاع الهدايا التي قدمها إلى الخطيب الآخر ما لم يتعذر العدول من قبله أو وجد شرط خاص. [S2]", "status": "answered", "abstain_reason": null, "latency_ms": 28700.573550000627, "timings": {"bm25": 2.0062989997313707, "embed": 172.5058590000117, "dense": 10.142463000192947, "rerank": 6761.117557000034, "total": 28700.52484899952, "llm": 21753.477786000076}, "usage": {"input_tokens": 1105, "output_tokens": 44, "cost_usd": 0.0015944736027221956}, "cited": ["csp:art2:1"], "retrieved": ["csp:art28:1", "csp:art2:1", "csp:art209:1", "csp:art213:1", "csp:art212:1"], "verification": {"cited_ids": [2], "invalid_ids": [], "unverified_articles": [], "unsupported_numbers": [], "sentences": 2}, "citation_precision": 1.0, "gold_cited": true, "support_scores": [0.024381307885050774], "faithful_sentences": 0, "cited_sentences": 1, "fact_hits": [true, true], "correct": true, "forbidden_found": []}
{"id": "fr-006", "lang": "fr", "cat": "factual", "answerable": true, "question": "Quels sont les cas de divorce prévus par le Code du statut personnel ?", "answer": "Le Code du statut personnel prévoit trois cas de divorce :\n\n1. Par accord entre les époux.\n2. Par demande d'un des époux en raison d'un dommage subi.\n3. Par volonté de l'un des époux pour le divorce ou pour demander au conjoint de le faire.\n\nCes cas sont décrits dans le \"fifth source\" [S3] du Code du statut personnel.", "status": "answered", "abstain_reason": null, "latency_ms": 57857.51029699986, "timings": {"bm25": 1.410041000781348, "embed": 163.31049100062955, "dense": 3.62624900026276, "rerank": 8609.707004000484, "total": 57857.44685200007, "llm": 49077.414909000254}, "usage": {"input_tokens": 1820, "output_tokens": 91, "cost_usd": 0.0032143026028888925}, "cited": ["csp:art32:2"], "retrieved": ["csp:art31:1", "csp:art29:1", "csp:art32:2", "csp:art32:1", "csp:art32bis:1"], "verification": {"cited_ids": [3], "invalid_ids": [], "unverified_articles": [], "unsupported_numbers": ["1"], "sentences": 5}, "citation_precision": 0.0, "gold_cited": false, "support_scores": [0.00028615424525924027], "faithful_sentences": 0, "cited_sentences": 1, "fact_hits": [false, false], "correct": false, "forbidden_found": []}
{"id": "en-003", "lang": "en", "cat": "factual", "answerable": true, "question": "What does Tunisian law say about child custody after divorce?", "answer": "[S1][S4] Tunisian law states that after a divorce, custody is given to the surviving parent if the other is alive. If both parents are alive, custody can be given to one of them or to someone else. The judge must consider the best interests of the child when making this decision. The custodial parent has the authority to handle the child's travel, education, and financial matters. The judge may also delegate guardianship to the custodial parent if the guardian cannot fulfill their duties or if the child's well-being is at risk.", "status": "answered", "abstain_reason": null, "latency_ms": 53228.633091999654, "timings": {"bm25": 2.2074850003264146, "embed": 189.78117799997563, "dense": 0.416653000684164, "rerank": 9115.464993000387, "total": 53228.58108299988, "llm": 43919.127449999905}, "usage": {"input_tokens": 1534, "output_tokens": 113, "cost_usd": 0.0029571433934999936}, "cited": ["civil_status_1957:art42:1", "csp:art67:1"], "retrieved": ["civil_status_1957:art42:1", "alimony_fund_1993:art10:1", "surname_abandoned_children_1998:art6:1", "csp:art67:1", "guardianship_adoption_1958:art10:1"], "verification": {"cited_ids": [1, 4], "invalid_ids": [], "unverified_articles": [], "unsupported_numbers": [], "sentences": 5}, "citation_precision": 0.5, "gold_cited": true, "support_scores": [0.7619038820266724], "faithful_sentences": 1, "cited_sentences": 1, "fact_hits": [true], "correct": true, "forbidden_found": []}
